# `cmd/golem-bake`

The **`golem` binary**: parses args and calls `codegen.Bake` with the current working directory as the project root. No schema logic, templates, or runtime code—keep it minimal. New commands belong here with a small `main` and delegation to the right package.

`golem-bake --remove-integration <name>` delegates to `codegen.RemoveIntegration` for explicit retirement of configured shared-only bridges. It does not bake or modify configuration in removal mode.
